  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"6993\" class=\"elementor elementor-6993\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-571f51e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"37217\" data-id=\"571f51e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ede33ae\" data-eae-slider=\"27007\" data-id=\"ede33ae\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a93f0aa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a93f0aa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>What is a Family Law Attorney?</h2><p>A family law attorney is an attorney who specializes in cases involving families, marriage, and divorce. They can provide legal advice, mediation representation, and litigation services in a variety of areas including divorce, adoption, child custody, and prenuptial agreements.</p><p> </p><p>Family law attorneys help their clients resolve disputes related to family matters, such as divorce, custody, visitation, and support. They provide legal advice on matters involving family law, draft legal documents, represent clients in court, and attend mediation with their clients.</p><p> </p><p>Family law attorneys are invaluable during the divorce process, where they are responsible for filing the necessary paperwork, setting up property division and custody agreements, and negotiating out-of-court settlements. In cases of adoption, family law attorneys can help their clients navigate the process and complete the appropriate paperwork.</p><p> </p><p>For parents going through separation or divorce, a family law attorney can help design and implement custody and visitation arrangements that serve their children’s best interests. Additionally, for those who are married or soon-to-be married, family law attorneys can help draft prenuptial or post-nuptial agreements to protect assets and ensure a fair distribution of assets in case of divorce.</p><p> </p><p>A family law attorney can be a trusted guide who provides sound legal advice. They will have a thorough understanding of the law, be able to explain the implications of your decisions clearly and strive to resolve disputes efficiently. By working closely with their clients, a family law attorney can help ensure their rights and interests are fully protected.</p><p> </p><p>The Drake Law firm was founded in 2011 to provide solution-oriented legal representation in Family Law, Divorce, Child Custody, and Child Support. We have proudly served clients from Golden, Denver, and the surrounding cities since then. Our team is made up of passionate and experienced attorneys who will help you find real solutions and clear answers. Contact us today by giving us a call at <a href=\"tel:303-261-8111\"> 303-261-8111.</a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"
  },
